{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"31":"The Book of Manumission of Slaves"},"section_detail":{"31":{"hadithnumber_first":3926,"hadithnumber_last":3968,"arabicnumber_first":3926,"arabicnumber_last":3968,"name_native":"كتاب عتاق العبيد"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3952,"arabicnumber":3952,"text":"حدثنا ابو بكر بن ابي شيبة، حدثنا ابو اسامة، عن سعيد، عن قتادة، عن جابر بن زيد، والحسن، مثله . قال ابو داود سعيد احفظ من حماد","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Maqtu"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih Maqtu"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":31,"hadith":27}}]}